description	"Luxa

A backstabbing corpo with high mobility and high tech crowd control abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
-- Cheap Shot (Cripples On Hit)
- Exchange Scout Pistol (3)
-- 10% more damage/FP damage
-- 20% Faster RoF
-- 15% Slower Velocity
-- Mag Reload
- Thermal Detonator (1)
- Cyroban Grenade (2)
-- Tracks
- Tripmines (3)
-- Disarms, Knocks Down

^6Inventory:
- Personal Shield Generator (Cloak 2)

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)
- Dexterity (2)
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Stat Viewer
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller
- Sense Immunity

^3Abilities:
- Deceive (Disguise 3) ^3[Melee Weap Mode]
- Gunkick ^3[CS1 Weapon Out]
- Weighted Tracking Darts (8) ^3[Melee CS1]
-- Knocksback On Hit
- Grav Laser (Wrist Laser) ^3[CS2]
-- Pulls On Hit
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS4 Weapon Out]
- Flash Cord (Grapple 2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
-- Blinds/Slips/Pulls
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"